## 3. Custom Lightning Types & LWC Architecture

Custom Lightning Types bridge Agentforce's generative AI context with custom Lightning Web Components.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class CreateVisitWrapper {
        +String subject
        +String accountId
        +DateTime plannedStartTime
        +String placeId
        +String visitTemplateId
        +DateTime plannedEndTime
        +Boolean isAllDayEvent
        +String accountableId
        +String responsibleId
    }

    class createVisitWrapperType {
        <<LightningType>>
        schema.json: @apexClassType/c__CreateVisitWrapper
        editor.json: c/createVisitEditor
    }

    class createVisitEditor {
        <<LWC Component>>
        +CreateVisitWrapper value
        +String visitId
        +searchAccounts()
        +searchPlaces()
        +searchTemplates()
        +searchUsers()
        +getResponsibleUserContext()
        +dispatchChange()
    }

    class VisitUpdatePayload {
        +String visitId
        +String updatesJson
    }

    class visitUpdatePayloadType {
        <<LightningType>>
        schema.json: @apexClassType/c__VisitUpdatePayload
        editor.json: c/visitUpdaterWizard
    }

